                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "PomPomPurin and Cinnamoroll invent a seesaw mill to pound peanuts using an old tyre, a log and some big mushrooms. When he bounces up and flies away, the inventive PomPomPurin must figure out a way to get back to his friends!",
