                        "jpn": "大切なサングラス"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Hello Kitty and her friends put funny hats on their heads, but when the wind blows their hats away they suffer in the vegetable garden from the strong rays of the sun. That evening, they set to work to make sunglasses to protect themselves from the sun the next day.",
